lass="font-display text-3xl" style="color:#1C1917;transition-delay:0ms;opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity 400ms ease, transform 400ms ease" href="/blog" data-discover="true">Blog</a><a class="btn-primary mt-6" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity 400ms ease 250ms, transform 400ms ease 250ms" href="/contacto" data-discover="true">Contactar</a><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mt-4"><button aria-current="page" aria-label="Cambiar idioma a Español" class="font-body text-sm font-medium bg-transparent border-none cursor-pointer" style="color:#C9A87C">ES</button><span style="color:#94A3B8">/</span><button aria-label="Switch language to English" class="font-body text-sm font-medium bg-transparent border-none cursor-pointer" style="color:#94A3B8">EN</button></div></nav></div><main id="main-content"><section class="relative w-full overflow-hidden" style="height:100dvh;min-height:600px"><div class="absolute inset-0 will-change-clip-path" style="clip-path:circle(0% at 50% 50%);z-index:1"><video autoPlay="" muted="" loop="" playsInline="" preload="metadata" poster="/hero-bg.jpg" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover" style="transform:scale(1.05)"><source media="(max-width: 768px)" src="/hero-video-mobile.webm" type="video/webm"/><source media="(max-width: 768px)" src="/hero-video-mobile.mp4" type="video/mp4"/><source src="/hero-video.webm" type="video/webm"/><source src="/hero-video.mp4" type="video/mp4"/><picture><source type="image/avif" media="(max-width: 767px)" srcSet="/hero-bg-mobile.avif"/><source type="image/webp" media="(max-width: 767px)" srcSet="/hero-bg-mobile.webp"/><source type="image/jpeg" media="(max-width: 767px)" srcSet="/hero-bg-mobile.jpg"/><source type="image/avif" srcSet="/hero-bg.avif"/><source type="image/webp" srcSet="/hero-bg.webp"/><img src="/hero-bg.jpg" alt="Vista aerea de Punta de Mita al atardecer" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover will-change-transform" style="transform:scale(1.05)" loading="eager"/></picture></video></div><div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-color:rgba(10,10,10,0.6);background:linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(10,10,10,0.1) 0%, rgba(10,10,10,0.2) 40%, rgba(10,10,10,0.5) 100%);z-index:2"></div><canvas class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none hidden lg:block" style="z-index:4"></canvas><div class="relative flex flex-col justify-end h-full px-5 sm:px-10 lg:px-20 pb-16 sm:pb-20 lg:pb-24 max-w-[1920px] mx-auto" style="z-index:5;opacity:0"><span class="label-text block mb-4 lg:mb-6" style="color:#C9A87C;opacity:0">PUNTA DE MITA, RIVIERA NAYARIT</span><h1 class="perspective-1000 max-w-4xl" style="font-size:clamp(40px, 6vw, 72px);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-0.03em;color:#F5F0EB;font-weight:400;text-wrap:balance"><span class="word inline-block mr-[0.3em]" style="opacity:0">Punta</span><span class="word inline-block mr-[0.3em]" style="opacity:0">de</span><span class="word inline-block mr-[0.3em]" style="opacity:0">Mita</span><span class="word inline-block mr-[0.3em]" style="opacity:0">empieza</span><span class="word inline-block mr-[0.3em]" style="opacity:0">aquí.</span></h1><p class="font-body mt-5 lg:mt-6 max-w-xl" style="font-size:clamp(16px, 1.4vw, 20px);line-height:1.65;color:rgba(245, 240, 235, 0.85);opacity:0">192 unidades diseñadas como punto de entrada al ecosistema más estructurado de la Riviera Nayarit. Terrenos desde $9,500 MXN/m². Departamentos en preventa desde $2.9M MXN.</p><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 sm:gap-4 mt-8 lg:mt-10" style="opacity:0"><a class="btn-primary" href="/lotes" data-discover="true">Ver lotes disponibles</a><a class="btn-ghost" href="/contacto" data-discover="true">Contactar</a></div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-6 sm:gap-10 mt-10 lg:mt-14" style="opacity:0"><div class="flex flex-col"><span class="data-text font-mono" style="font-size:clamp(20px, 1.8vw, 28px);color:#C9A87C;letter-spacing:-0.02em;line-height:1.2">12</span><span class="font-body mt-1" style="font-size:12px;color:rgba(245, 240, 235, 0.6);letter-spacing:0.02em;text-transform:lowercase">lotes disponibles</span></div><div class="flex flex-col"><span class="data-text font-mono" style="font-size:clamp(20px, 1.8vw, 28px);color:#C9A87C;letter-spacing:-0.02em;line-height:1.2">$9,500</span><span class="font-body mt-1" style="font-size:12px;color:rgba(245, 240, 235, 0.6);letter-spacing:0.02em;text-transform:lowercase">MXN/m²</span></div><div class="flex flex-col"><span class="data-text font-mono" style="font-size:clamp(20px, 1.8vw, 28px);color:#C9A87C;letter-spacing:-0.02em;line-height:1.2">192</span><span class="font-body mt-1" style="font-size:12px;color:rgba(245, 240, 235, 0.6);letter-spacing:0.02em;text-transform:lowercase">unidades</span></div></div></div><div style="opacity:0;z-index:5"><div class="absolute bottom-8 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 flex flex-col items-center gap-2 animate-scroll-indicator" style="z-index:5"><span class="font-body text-xs tracking-widest uppercase" style="color:rgba(245,240,235,0.5);letter-spacing:0.1em">Scroll</span><svg width="20" height="32" viewBox="0 0 20 32" fill="none" style="opacity:0.5"><rect x="1" y="1" width="18" height="30" rx="9" stroke="rgba(245,240,235,0.5)" stroke-width="1.5"></rect><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="3" fill="rgba(245,240,235,0.6)"><animate attributeName="cy" values="8;20;8" dur="2s" repeatCount="indefinite"></animate><animate attributeName="opacity" values="0.8;0.3;0.8" dur="2s" repeatCount="indefinite"></animate></circle></svg></div></div></section><section id="ecosistema" class="relative overflow-hidden" style="background-color:#1E3A4F;padding-top:clamp(80px, 10vw, 160px);padding-bottom:clamp(80px, 10vw, 160px)"><div class="absolute inset-0 will-change-transform" style="top:-10%;height:120%;opacity:0.06;z-index:0"><img src="/ecosistema-aerea.jpg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="w-full h-full object-cover" loading="lazy"/></div><div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-px" style="background-color:rgba(245, 240, 235, 0.1)"></div><div class="relative mx-auto px-5 sm:px-10 lg:px-20 max-w-[1440px]" style="z-index:1"><span class="label-text block mb-4 lg:mb-6" style="color:#C9A87C;opacity:0">EL ECOSISTEMA</span><h2 class="font-display max-w-3xl" style="font-size:clamp(32px, 4.5vw, 56px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.015em;color:#F5F0EB;font-weight:400;text-wrap:balance;opacity:0">600 hectáreas. Un plan. Desde 1994.</h2><p class="font-body mt-5 lg:mt-6 max-w-2xl" style="font-size:clamp(16px, 1.2vw, 18px);line-height:1.65;color:#94A3B8;opacity:0">La única península del Pacífico Mexicano con master plan controlado. Su superficie es finita y el plan ya está definido. Esa es la diferencia entre un ecosistema y un destino.</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-4 gap-4 lg:gap-6 mt-14 lg:mt-20"><div class="data-card group relative p-7 lg:p-8 transition-all duration-400" style="background-color:rgba(245, 240, 235, 0.05);border:1px solid rgba(245, 240, 235, 0.08);opacity:0"><div class="mb-5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-waves" aria-hidden="true" style="color:#C9A87C"><path d="M2 6c.6.5 1.2 1 2.5 1C7 7 7 5 9.5 5c2.6 0 2.4 2 5 2 2.5 0 2.5-2 5-2 1.3 0 1.9.5 2.5 1"></path><path d="M2 12c.6.5 1.2 1 2.5 1 2.5 0 2.5-2 5-2 2.6 0 2.4 2 5 2 2.5 0 2.5-2 5-2 1.3 0 1.9.5 2.5 1"></path><path d="M2 18c.6.5 1.2 1 2.5 1 2.5 0 2.5-2 5-2 2.6 0 2.4 2 5 2 2.5 0 2.5-2 5-2 1.3 0 1.9.5 2.5 1"></path></svg></div><span class="font-mono block" style="font-size:clamp(40px, 4vw, 56px);line-height:0.9;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#C9A87C;font-weight:400">12</span><span class="label-text block mt-4" style="color:#F5F0EB;font-size:12px">PLAYAS NADABLES</span><p class="font-body mt-3" style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#94A3B8">Agua templada todo el año, entre 23°C y 29°C</p></div><div class="data-card group relative p-7 lg:p-8 transition-all duration-400" style="background-color:rgba(245, 240, 235, 0.05);border:1px solid rgba(245, 240, 235, 0.08);opacity:0"><div class="mb-5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plane" aria-hidden="true" style="color:#C9A87C"><path d="M17.8 19.2 16 11l3.5-3.5C21 6 21.5 4 21 3c-1-.5-3 0-4.5 1.5L13 8 4.8 6.2c-.5-.1-.9.1-1.1.5l-.3.5c-.2.5-.1 1 .3 1.3L9 12l-2 3H4l-1 1 3 2 2 3 1-1v-3l3-2 3.5 5.3c.3.4.8.5 1.3.3l.5-.2c.4-.3.6-.7.5-1.2z"></path></svg></div><span class="font-mono block" style="font-size:clamp(40px, 4vw, 56px);line-height:0.9;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#C9A87C;font-weight:400">50+</span><span class="label-text block mt-4" style="color:#F5F0EB;font-size:12px">RUTAS AÉREAS</span><p class="font-body mt-3" style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#94A3B8">Vuelos directos al aeropuerto de Puerto Vallarta</p></div><div class="data-card group relative p-7 lg:p-8 transition-all duration-400" style="background-color:rgba(245, 240, 235, 0.05);border:1px solid rgba(245, 240, 235, 0.08);opacity:0"><div class="mb-5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-flag" aria-hidden="true" style="color:#C9A87C"><path d="M4 22V4a1 1 0 0 1 .4-.8A6 6 0 0 1 8 2c3 0 5 2 7.333 2q2 0 3.067-.8A1 1 0 0 1 20 4v10a1 1 0 0 1-.4.8A6 6 0 0 1 16 16c-3 0-5-2-8-2a6 6 0 0 0-4 1.528"></path></svg></div><span class="font-mono block" style="font-size:clamp(40px, 4vw, 56px);line-height:0.9;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#C9A87C;font-weight:400">2</span><span class="label-text block mt-4" style="color:#F5F0EB;font-size:12px">CAMPOS JACK NICKLAUS</span><p class="font-body mt-3" style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#94A3B8">Signature Golf en la península, incluyendo el hoyo Tail of the Whale</p></div><div class="data-card group relative p-7 lg:p-8 transition-all duration-400" style="background-color:rgba(245, 240, 235, 0.05);border:1px solid rgba(245, 240, 235, 0.08);opacity:0"><div class="mb-5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-fish" aria-hidden="true" style="color:#C9A87C"><path d="M6.5 12c.94-3.46 4.94-6 8.5-6 3.56 0 6.06 2.54 7 6-.94 3.47-3.44 6-7 6s-7.56-2.53-8.5-6Z"></path><path d="M18 12v.5"></path><path d="M16 17.93a9.77 9.77 0 0 1 0-11.86"></path><path d="M7 10.67C7 8 5.58 5.97 2.73 5.5c-1 1.5-1 5 .23 6.5-1.24 1.5-1.24 5-.23 6.5C5.58 18.03 7 16 7 13.33"></path><path d="M10.46 7.26C10.2 5.88 9.17 4.24 8 3h5.8a2 2 0 0 1 1.98 1.67l.23 1.4"></path><path d="m16.01 17.93-.23 1.4A2 2 0 0 1 13.8 21H9.5a5.96 5.96 0 0 0 1.49-3.98"></path></svg></div><span class="font-mono block" style="font-size:clamp(40px, 4vw, 56px);line-height:0.9;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#C9A87C;font-weight:400">300-500</span><span class="label-text block mt-4" style="color:#F5F0EB;font-size:12px">BALLENAS JOROBADAS</span><p class="font-body mt-3" style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#94A3B8">Cada invierno, de diciembre a marzo, en Bahía de Banderas</p></div></div><div class="mt-12 lg:mt-16 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center gap-4 sm:gap-8"><a class="inline-block font-body text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-wider px-8 py-4 transition-all duration-300" style="border:1px solid #C9A87C;color:#C9A87C;letter-spacing:0.05em;font-size:13px" href="/lotes" data-discover="true">Ver lotes disponibles</a><span class="font-body text-sm" style="color:#94A3B8">12 lotes finales desde $9,500 MXN/m²</span></div></div></section><section id="desarrollo" style="background-color:#F5F0EB;padding-top:clamp(64px, 8vw, 96px);padding-bottom:clamp(64px, 8vw, 96px)"><div class="mx-auto px-5 sm:px-10 lg:px-20 max-w-[1440px]"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-center"><div style="opacity:0"><span class="label-text block mb-4" style="color:#C9A87C">EL DESARROLLO</span><h2 class="font-display" style="font-size:clamp(32px, 4vw, 56px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.015em;color:#1C1917;font-weight:400;text-wrap:balance">192 unidades. Un mismo criterio.</h2><p class="font-body mt-5 lg:mt-6" style="font-size:clamp(16px, 1.2vw, 18px);line-height:1.65;color:#94A3B8;max-width:480px">Cumbres de Mita es un desarrollo de 157 lotes residenciales, 8 unidades en Nahya Residences y 27 departamentos en Kumo Living, en Corral del Risco, Punta de Mita. Diseñado por CAM Grupo.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-8 mt-8"><div class="flex flex-col"><span class="data-text font-mono" style="font-size:clamp(28px, 2.5vw, 48px);color:#C9A87C;letter-spacing:-0.02em;line-height:1">157</span><span class="font-body mt-1" style="font-size:12px;color:#94A3B8;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase">lotes</span></div><div class="flex flex-col"><span class="data-text font-mono" style="font-size:clamp(28px, 2.5vw, 48px);color:#C9A87C;letter-spacing:-0.02em;line-height:1">$9,500</span><span class="font-body mt-1" style="font-size:12px;color:#94A3B8;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase">MXN/m²</span></div><div class="flex flex-col"><span class="data-text font-mono" style="font-size:clamp(28px, 2.5vw, 48px);color:#C9A87C;letter-spacing:-0.02em;line-height:1">2027</span><span class="font-body mt-1" style="font-size:12px;color:#94A3B8;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase">entrega estimada</span></div></div><a class="btn-primary mt-8 inline-block" href="/desarrollo" data-discover="true">Conocer el desarrollo</a></div><div class="relative overflow-hidden" style="opacity:0"><picture><source srcSet="/desarrollo-aerea.avif" type="image/avif"/><source srcSet="/desarrollo-aerea.webp" type="image/webp"/><img src="/desarrollo-aerea.jpg" alt="Vista aérea de Cumbres de Mita" class="w-full h-auto object-cover" style="aspect-ratio:16/10" loading="lazy"/></picture></div></div></div></section><section id="lotes" style="background-color:#3D4A3A;padding-top:clamp(64px, 8vw, 96px);padding-bottom:clamp(64px, 8vw, 96px)"><div class="mx-auto px-5 sm:px-10 lg:px-20 max-w-[1440px]"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-center"><div class="lg:col-span-2" style="opacity:0"><span class="label-text block mb-4" style="color:#C9A87C">LOTES</span><h2 class="font-display" style="font-size:clamp(32px, 4vw, 56px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.015em;color:#F5F0EB;font-weight:400;text-wrap:balance">12 lotes. 145 vendidos en preventa.</h2><p class="font-body mt-5 lg:mt-6" style="font-size:clamp(16px, 1.2vw, 18px);line-height:1.65;color:#94A3B8">Desde 160 m². Vista a la selva, todos con acceso a la Casa Club, alberca infinity, gym, senderos y seguridad 24/7.</p><div class="mt-6"><span class="font-mono" style="font-size:clamp(18px, 1.5vw, 24px);font-weight:500;color:#C9A87C;letter-spacing:-0.02em">Desde $9,500 MXN/m²</span></div><a class="btn-primary mt-8 inline-block" href="/lotes" data-discover="true">Ver lotes disponibles</a></div><div class="lg:col-span-3 relative overflow-hidden" style="opacity:0"><img src="/lote-vista.jpg" alt="Vista de lotes residenciales en Cumbres de Mita" class="w-full object-cover will-change-transform" style="aspect-ratio:16/10" loading="lazy"/></div></div></div></section><section id="nahya" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;padding-top:clamp(64px, 8vw, 96px);padding-bottom:clamp(64px, 8vw, 96px)"><div class="mx-auto px-5 sm:px-10 lg:px-20 max-w-[1440px]"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-center"><div class="order-2 lg:order-1" style="opacity:0"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4"><span class="label-text block" style="color:#C9A87C">NAHYA RESIDENCES</span><span class="font-mono" style="font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.12em;color:#3D4A3A;background-color:rgba(61, 74, 58, 0.08);padding:4px 10px;border:1px solid rgba(61, 74, 58, 0.2)">100% VENDIDO</span></div><h2 class="font-display" style="font-size:clamp(32px, 4vw, 56px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.015em;color:#1C1917;font-weight:400;text-wrap:balance">8 unidades. 8 vendidas. Primer hito.</h2><p class="font-body mt-5 lg:mt-6" style="font-size:clamp(16px, 1.2vw, 18px);line-height:1.65;color:#94A3B8;max-width:480px">2 torres boutique de 4 unidades cada una. 100 m² por residencia, acabados premium, entrega 2025. La primera fase de Cumbres de Mita que se agotó en preventa.</p><a class="btn-secondary mt-8 inline-block" href="/nahya" data-discover="true">Ver el caso de éxito</a></div><div class="relative overflow-hidden order-1 lg:order-2" style="opacity:0"><picture><source srcSet="/nahya-render.avif" type="image/avif"/><source srcSet="/nahya-render.webp" type="image/webp"/><img src="/nahya-render.jpg" alt="Nahya Residences — terraza" class="w-full object-cover" style="aspect-ratio:16/10" loading="lazy"/></picture></div></div></div></section><section id="kumo" style="background-color:#F5F0EB;padding-top:clamp(64px, 8vw, 96px);padding-bottom:clamp(64px, 8vw, 96px)"><div class="mx-auto px-5 sm:px-10 lg:px-20 max-w-[1440px]"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-center"><div class="relative overflow-hidden order-2 lg:order-1" style="opacity:0"><img src="/kumo-render.jpg" alt="Kumo Living - Departamentos en preventa" class="w-full object-cover" style="aspect-ratio:16/10" loading="lazy"/></div><div class="order-1 lg:order-2" style="opacity:0"><span class="label-text block mb-4" style="color:#C9A87C">KUMO LIVING</span><h2 class="font-display" style="font-size:clamp(32px, 4vw, 56px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.015em;color:#1C1917;font-weight:400;text-wrap:balance">27 departamentos. Mismo ecosistema.</h2><p class="font-body mt-5 lg:mt-6" style="font-size:clamp(16px, 1.2vw, 18px);line-height:1.65;color:#94A3B8;max-width:480px">Departamentos de 1 y 2 recámaras con vista al mar. Rooftop común. Elevador. Estacionamiento. Preventa. Entrega 2027.</p><div class="mt-6"><span class="font-mono" style="font-size:clamp(18px, 1.5vw, 24px);font-weight:500;color:#C9A87C;letter-spacing:-0.02em">Desde $2.9M MXN</span></div><a class="btn-primary mt-8 inline-block" href="/kumo-living" data-discover="true">Ver departamentos</a></div></div></div></section><section id="amenidades" style="background-color:#F5F0EB;padding-top:clamp(64px, 8vw, 96px);padding-bottom:clamp(64px, 8vw, 96px)"><div class="mx-auto px-5 sm:px-10 lg:px-20 max-w-[1440px]"><div class="mb-12 lg:mb-16"><span class="label-text block mb-4" style="color:#C9A87C">AMENIDADES</span><h2 class="font-display" style="font-size:clamp(32px, 4vw, 56px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.015em;color:#1C1917;font-weight:400;text-wrap:balance">Amenidades que se usan.</h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3 gap-6"><div class="amenidad-card group" style="opacity:0"><div class="relative overflow-hidden"><img src="/amenidades-club.jpg" alt="Casa Club" class="w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105" style="aspect-ratio:16/10" loading="lazy"/></div><div class="pt-5"><h3 class="font-body" style="font-size:20px;font-weight:500;color:#1C1917;line-height:1.3">Casa Club</h3><p class="font-body mt-2" style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#94A3B8">Salón de eventos, coworking, área social con vista panorámica.</p></div></div><div class="amenidad-card group" style="opacity:0"><div class="relative overflow-hidden"><img src="/amenidades-alberca.jpg" alt="Alberca Infinity" class="w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105" style="aspect-ratio:16/10" loading="lazy"/></div><div class="pt-5"><h3 class="font-body" style="font-size:20px;font-weight:500;color:#1C1917;line-height:1.3">Alberca Infinity</h3><p class="font-body mt-2" style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#94A3B8">Con vista al mar. Climatizada.</p></div></div><div class="amenidad-card group" style="opacity:0"><div class="relative overflow-hidden"><img src="/amenidades-gym.jpg" alt="Gym + Yoga" class="w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105" style="aspect-ratio:16/10" loading="lazy"/></div><div class="pt-5"><h3 class="font-body" style="font-size:20px;font-weight:500;color:#1C1917;line-height:1.3">Gym + Yoga</h3><p class="font-body mt-2" style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#94A3B8">Equipamiento profesional. Studio para yoga con vista a la selva.</p></div></div></div><div class="mt-10 text-center"><p class="font-body" style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#94A3B8">Senderos naturales · Área pet-friendly · Seguridad 24/7 · Estacionamiento techado</p></div><div class="mt-8 text-center"><a class="btn-secondary inline-block" href="/amenidades" data-discover="true">Ver todas las amenidades</a></div></div></section><section id="contacto" style="background-color:#1E3A4F;padding-top:clamp(64px, 8vw, 96px);padding-bottom:clamp(64px, 8vw, 96px)"><div class="mx-auto px-5 sm:px-10 lg:px-20 max-w-[1440px]"><div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center"><h2 class="cta-animate font-display" style="font-size:clamp(32px, 4vw, 56px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.015em;color:#F5F0EB;font-weight:400;text-wrap:balance;opacity:0">Hablemos de números.</h2><p class="cta-animate font-body mt-5 lg:mt-6" style="font-size:clamp(16px, 1.2vw, 18px);line-height:1.65;color:#94A3B8;max-width:560px;opacity:0">12 lotes finales disponibles. 27 departamentos en preventa. Precios desde $9,500 MXN/m².</p><div class="cta-animate flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 mt-8" style="opacity:0"><a class="btn-primary" href="/contacto" data-discover="true">Contactar</a><a href="https://wa.me/523112028186" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Contactar por WhatsApp" class="btn-secondary" st